      "id": "q2",
      "type": "explain",
      "q": "Why is a 14 day return option not a real risk reversal for EU consumers buying online?",
      "a": "The 14 day right of withdrawal is already required by law, so only an offer beyond it reduces risk further.",
      "anchor": "#guarantees-and-the-law",
      "origin": "ai",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "q3",
      "type": "explain",
      "q": "Why can a generous guarantee be unprofitable for some products?",
      "a": "It can raise refunds as well as conversions, so the net effect depends on the product; measure both.",
